{"id":"nacer","lemma":"nacer","pos":"verb","rank":1718,"glosses":["to be born, to sprout, to begin to grow; to hatch (out)","to grow; to rise, to have its source (river); to rise (sun); to have its roots; to arise","to feel a desire or an urge to do something without anyone asking you to"],"ipa":"/naˈθeɾ/","conjugation":{"indicative":{"present":{"1s":"nazco","2s":"naces","3s":"nace","1p":"nacemos","2p":"nacéis","3p":"nacen"},"imperfect":{"1s":"nacía","2s":"nacías","3s":"nacía","1p":"nacíamos","2p":"nacíais","3p":"nacían"},"preterite":{"1s":"nací","2s":"naciste","3s":"nació","1p":"nacimos","2p":"nacisteis","3p":"nacieron"},"future":{"1s":"naceré","2s":"nacerás","3s":"nacerá","1p":"naceremos","2p":"naceréis","3p":"nacerán"},"conditional":{"1s":"nacería","2s":"nacerías","3s":"nacería","1p":"naceríamos","2p":"naceríais","3p":"nacerían"}},"subjunctive":{"present":{"1s":"nazca","2s":"nazcas","3s":"nazca","1p":"nazcamos","2p":"nazcáis","3p":"nazcan"},"imperfect":{"1s":"naciera","2s":"nacieras","3s":"naciera","1p":"naciéramos","2p":"nacierais","3p":"nacieran"}},"imperative":{"affirmative":{"2s":"nace","3s":"nazca","1p":"nazcamos","2p":"naced","3p":"nazcan"},"negative":{"2s":"nazcas","3s":"nazca","1p":"nazcamos","2p":"nazcáis","3p":"nazcan"}}},"nonFinite":{"gerund":"naciendo","participle":"nacido"},"audio":"https://upload.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/b/b3/LL-Q1321_%28spa%29-AdrianAbdulBaha-nacer.wav","formAudio":{"nacido":"https://upload.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/8/87/LL-Q1321_%28spa%29-Emanuelps27-nacido.wav"},"examples":[{"text":"Todos mis bisabuelos fallecieron antes de nacer yo.","en":"All of my great-grandparents died before I was born.","audio":"https://tatoeba.org/en/audio/download/559092"},{"text":"Desearía haber nacido canadiense.","en":"I wish I'd been born Canadian.","audio":"https://tatoeba.org/en/audio/download/302342"},{"text":"Uno es de donde pace, no de donde nace.","en":"Home is where the heart is.","audio":"https://tatoeba.org/en/audio/download/1198033"},{"text":"Nacemos pecadores y pecadores morimos.","en":"We are born sinners and we die sinners."},{"text":"Nací en un barco.","en":"I was born on a ship.","audio":"https://tatoeba.org/en/audio/download/162864"}]}